---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Websites that turn local searches into bookings</h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">
      I redesign outdated websites into fast, high-end sites that take bookings and payments, answer
      enquiries around the clock, and get found on Google and in AI search. Based in Bradford,
      working across West Yorkshire.
    </p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a href="#audit" class="btn btn-primary">
        Get your free presence audit
      </a>
      <a href="#work" class="btn btn-secondary">
        See concept work
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__slider-placeholder" id="work" aria-labelledby="slider-placeholder-heading">
      <p id="slider-placeholder-heading" class="hero__slider-label">
        Concept design, fictional business — before/after slider arrives in Phase 2
      </p>
      <div class="hero__slider-frame">
        <span>Barber · Electrician · Dental practice</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__slider-caption">
        Concept redesigns for fictional businesses. Drag to compare.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="hero__credentials">
      I've shipped live customer pages inside Lloyds Banking Group's Agile team, completed Harvard's
      CS50x, and finished a T Level in Digital Production, Design and Development.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .hero__sub {
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .hero__actions .btn-secondary {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
    border-color: transparent;
    padding-inline: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hero__slider-placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .hero__slider-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .hero__slider-frame {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .hero__slider-caption {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
  }

  .hero__credentials {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
</style>
